13 TL
(NLP-Based Intelligent Web Application Development) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Project Title: NLP Assistant - PHP Chatbot and Text Analyzer with Supabase) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Selected Stack:) Tj
T*
(- Frontend: HTML) Tj
T*
(- Backend: PHP) Tj
T*
(- Database: Supabase) Tj
T*
(- NLP Tools: NLTK and spaCy) Tj
T*
(- Supporting Assets: CSS, Bootstrap, JavaScript) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Overview:) Tj
T*
(The system accepts typed text or browser voice input, sends it to PHP endpoints,) Tj
T*
(calls a Python NLP processor using NLTK and spaCy, returns analysis and chatbot) Tj
T*
(responses, and stores conversation records in Supabase.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Implemented NLP Concepts:) Tj
T*
(1. Tokenization - NLTK displays tokenized user input.) Tj
T*
(2. Sentiment Analysis - NLTK VADER classifies Positive, Negative, or Neutral.) Tj
T*
(3. Voice-to-Text - browser microphone converts speech to text.) Tj
T*
(4. Text-to-Speech - Speak button reads chatbot output aloud.) Tj
T*
(5. Chatbot System - user vs bot interface with stored Supabase history.) Tj
T*
(6. Keyword Extraction - spaCy-assisted important term extraction.) Tj
T*
(7. Text Classification - Complaint, Inquiry, Feedback, Command, or General.) Tj
T*
(8. Entity Extraction - spaCy entities when the English model is installed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(System Workflow:) Tj
T*
(User input -> JavaScript fetch -> PHP endpoint -> Python NLP processor -> Supabase save -> JSON response -> UI display.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Supabase Table: chats) Tj
T*
(Fields: id, user_message, bot_response, tokens, keywords, sentiment, sentiment_score, classification, entities, created_at.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(How to Run:) Tj
T*
(1. Run database/nlp_assistant.sql in the Supabase SQL Editor.) Tj
T*
(2. Copy .env.example to .env and set SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_KEY.) Tj
T*
(3. python3 -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate) Tj
T*
(4. pip install -r requirements.txt) Tj
T*
(5. python3 -m spacy download en_core_web_sm) Tj
T*
(6. php -S 127.0.0.1:8000) Tj
T*
(7. Open http://127.0.0.1:8000) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Defense Demo Checklist:) Tj
T*
(Show chatbot, token list, sentiment result, keywords, classification, voice input, speech output, and Supabase history table.) Tj
T*
ET
